hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"485","Ahmad bin Yunus ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Aziz bin Al-Majishon ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujhe Abdullah bin Dinar ne khabar di, woh Hazrat Ibn Umar se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Zulm Qayamat ke din zulmaten hain."
"486","Musaddad aur Ishaq ne hum se hadees bayan ki, un dono ne kaha: hum se Muaz ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: mujh se mere walid ne hadees bayan ki, woh Qatada se, woh Abul Mutawakkil An-Naji se, woh Hazrat Abu Saeed se, woh Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Jab momin log Aag se khalas pa jayenge to Jannat aur Aag ke darmiyan ek qantara par rok liye jayenge, pas woh duniya mein aapas ke mazalim ka ek doosre se qisas lenge, hatta ke jab woh paak saaf kar diye jayenge aur sanwar diye jayenge to unhen Jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat di jayegi, pas qasam Hai Us Zaat ki Jis ke hath mein Muhammad ki jaan Hai, un mein se har ek apne Jannat wale thikane ko duniya mein apne thikane se zyada achhi tarah pehchanega."
"487","Musaddad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Yahya ne hadees bayan ki, woh Ibn Ajlan se, woh Saeed bin Abi Saeed Al-Maqburi se, woh Hazrat Abu Huraira se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho, pas beshak zulm Qayamat ke din zulmaten hain, aur fahash goi se bacho, pas beshak Allah fahash aur mutafahhish ko pasand nahin karta, aur bukhl se bacho, pas beshak us ne tum se pehle logon ko dawat di to unhon ne apne rishton ko qata kar diya, aur us ne unhen dawat di to unhon ne apni hurmaton ko halal kar liya."
"488","Abdullah bin Maslama ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Daud bin Qais ne hadees bayan ki, woh Ubaidullah bin Miqsam se, woh Hazrat Jabir se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Zulm se bacho, pas beshak zulm Qayamat ke din zulmaten hain, aur bukhl se daro, pas beshak us ne tum se pehle logon ko halak kiya, aur us ne unhen is par ubhara ke unhon ne apne khoon bahaye, aur unhon ne apni hurmaton ko halal kar liya."
"489","Sulaiman bin Harb ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne hadees bayan ki, woh Asim se, woh Abu Ad-Duha se, unhon ne kaha: Masrooq aur Shutair bin Shakal masjid mein jama hue, to masjid ke halqe un dono ki taraf toot kar aaye, to Masrooq ne kaha: Main in logon ko apni taraf jama hote nahin dekhta magar taake hum se khair sunen, pas ya to tum Hazrat Abdullah se hadees bayan karo main tumhari tasdeeq karunga, ya main Hazrat Abdullah se hadees bayan karun tum meri tasdeeq karoge, to us ne kaha: Ae Abu Aisha tum bayan karo, unhon ne kaha: Kya tum ne Hazrat Abdullah ko ye kehte hue suna Hai ke dono aankhen zina karti hain, aur dono hath zina karte hain, aur dono paon zina karte hain, aur sharmgah us ki tasdeeq karti Hai ya takzeeb karti Hai, to us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne bhi us se suna Hai, unhon ne kaha: To kya tum ne Hazrat Abdullah ko ye kehte hue suna Hai ke Quran mein halal aur haram aur amr aur nahi ko jama karne wali is ayat se badh kar koi ayat nahin ke beshak Allah adl aur ehsan aur qarabat wale ko dene ka hukm deta Hai, to us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne bhi us se suna Hai, unhon ne kaha: To kya tum ne Hazrat Abdullah ko ye kehte hue suna Hai ke Quran mein kushadagi lane mein is qaul se tez koi ayat nahin ke aur jo Allah se dare Allah us ke liye nikalne ka rasta bana deta Hai, to us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne bhi us se suna Hai, unhon ne kaha: To kya tum ne Hazrat Abdullah ko ye kehte hue suna Hai ke Quran mein supurdagi mein is qaul se sakht koi ayat nahin ke ae mere bando jinhon ne apni janon par zyadati ki Allah ki rehmat se mayoos na ho, to us ne kaha: Haan, unhon ne kaha: Aur main ne bhi us se suna Hai."
"490","Abdul Aala bin Mushir ne hum se hadees bayan ki, ya mujh tak un se riwayat pahunchi, unhon ne kaha: hum se Saeed bin Abdul Aziz ne hadees bayan ki, woh Rabia bin Yazid se, woh Abu Idris Al-Khaulani se, woh Hazrat Abu Zarr se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, woh Allah Tabarak wa Taala se, Us ne farmaya: Ae mere bando, beshak main ne zulm ko apni zaat par haram kiya Hai, aur us ko tumhare darmiyan haram qarar diya Hai, pas tum ek doosre par zulm na karo. Ae mere bando, beshak tum woh ho jo raat aur din khata karte ho aur main gunahon ko bakhshta Hun aur parwa nahin karta, pas tum mujh se bakhshish mango main tumhen bakhsh dunga. Ae mere bando, tum sab bhooke ho siwa us ke jise main khilaaun, pas tum mujh se khana mango main tumhen khilaaunga. Ae mere bando, tum sab nange ho siwa us ke jise main kapda pehnaaun, pas tum mujh se libas mango main tumhen pehnaaunga. Ae mere bando, agar tumhare awwal aur aakhir, aur tumhare insan aur jinn, tum mein se sab se zyada muttaqi bande ke dil par hon, to ye mere mulk mein kuch izafa nahin karega, aur agar woh sab se zyada fajir shakhs ke dil par hon, to ye mere mulk mein se kuch kam nahin karega, aur agar woh ek khule maidan mein jama hon phir mujh se mangen phir main un mein se har insan ko us ka manga ata kar dun, to ye mere mulk mein se kuch kam nahin karega, magar jaise samandar kam hota Hai ke us mein sui ek martaba dubo di jaye. Ae mere bando, ye sirf tumhare aamal hain jinhen main tumhare zimme jama karta Hun, pas jo khair paye use Allah ki hamd karni chahiye, aur jo us ke siwa paye to apne nafs ke siwa kisi ko malamat na kare. Abu Idris jab ye hadees bayan karte to apne ghutnon ke bal baith jate."
"491","Ishaq bin Al-Ala ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Amr bin Al-Haris ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdullah bin Salim ne hadees bayan ki, woh Muhammad Az-Zubaidi se, unhon ne kaha: hum se Sulaiman bin Amir ne hadees bayan ki, ke Ghutaif bin Al-Haris ne unhen khabar di, ke ek shakhs Hazrat Abu Ubaida bin Al-Jarrah ke paas aaya aur woh takleef mein the, to us ne kaha: Ameer ka sawab kis haal mein Hai, to unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jante ho tumhen kis cheez par sawab diya jata Hai, to us ne kaha: Us par jo humen nagawar lagte hue pesh aata Hai, to unhon ne kaha: Tumhen sirf us par sawab diya jata Hai jo tum ne Allah ke raste mein kharch kiya, aur tumhare liye kharch kiya gaya, phir unhon ne safar ke saman ki har cheez shumar ki hatta ke ghoray ki lagam tak pahunche, lekin ye takleef jo tumhare jismon ko lagti Hai Allah us ke zariye tumhare gunahon mein se kaffara kar deta Hai."
"492","Abdullah bin Muhammad ne hum se hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Abdul Malik bin Amr ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: hum se Zuhair bin Muhammad ne hadees bayan ki, woh Muhammad bin Amr bin Halhala se, woh Ata bin Yasar se, woh Hazrat Abu Saeed Al-Khudri aur Hazrat Abu Huraira se, woh Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se, Aap ne farmaya: Musalman ko jo thakan, aur marz, aur fikr, aur gham, aur takleef, aur ranj pahunchta Hai, hatta ke kaanta jo use chubhta Hai, magar Allah us ke zariye us ke gunahon mein se kaffara kar deta Hai."
